{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-66-1","title":"Psalms 66:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":66,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":66,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David exhorts to praise God; 5 to observe his great works; 8 to bless him for his gracious benefits. 12 He vows for himself religious service to God. 16 He declares God's special goodness to himself.</p>\n<p>A.M. 3469. B.C. 535. Make. 81:1; 95:1,2; 98:4; 100:1; 1Ch 15:28 all ye lands. Heb. all the earth. 96:1; 117:1,2; 150:6; 1Ch 16:23,24; Isa 24:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-66-2","title":"Psalms 66:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":66,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":66,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>47:6,7; 72:18; 96:3-10; 105:2,3; 106:2; 107:15,22; 1Ch 29:10-13 Ne 9:5; Isa 6:3; 12:4-6; 49:13; Re 4:8-11; 5:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-66-3","title":"Psalms 66:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":66,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":66,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>How terrible. 47:2; 65:5; 76:12; Ex 15:1-16,21; Jud 5:2-4,20-22; Isa 2:19; 64:3 Jer 10:10 through. 18:44; 22:28,29; 68:30; 81:15 submit themselves. or, yield feigned obedience. Heb. lie. 78:35,36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-66-4","title":"Psalms 66:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":66,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":66,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>22:27; 65:5; 67:2,3; 96:1,2; 117:1; Isa 2:2-4; 11:9; 42:10-12 Isa 49:22,23; Da 7:14; Mal 1:11; Re 15:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-66-5","title":"Psalms 66:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":66,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":66,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Come. 16; 46:8; 111:2; 126:1-3; Nu 23:23 terrible. 3; 99:3; Eze 1:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-66-6","title":"Psalms 66:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":66,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":66,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>He turned. 78:13; 106:8-10; 104:5-7; 136:13,14; Ex 14:21,22; Isa 63:13,14 they. Jos 3:14,16 there. 106:11,12; Ex 15:1-21; Re 15:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-66-7","title":"Psalms 66:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":66,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":66,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>ruleth. 62:11; Da 4:35; 6:26,27; Mt 6:13; 28:18 his eyes. 11:4; 33:13; 2Ch 16:9 let. 2:10-12; 52:1-5; 73:3-12; 75:4,5; Ex 18:11; Job 9:4; Isa 10:7-16 Isa 37:28,29; Da 5:20-28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-66-8","title":"Psalms 66:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":66,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":66,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>O bless. De 32:43; Ro 15:10,11 make. 2; 47:1; Jer 33:11; Re 5:11-14; 19:1,5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-66-9","title":"Psalms 66:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":66,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":66,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>holdeth. Heb. putteth. 22:29; 1Sa 25:29; Ac 17:28; Col 3:3,4 suffereth. 37:23,24; 62:2,6; 94:18; 112:6; 121:3; 125:3; 1Sa 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-66-10","title":"Psalms 66:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":66,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":66,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>hast proved us. 17:3; De 8:2,16; 13:3 tried. Pr 17:3; Isa 48:10; Zec 13:9; 1Pe 1:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-66-11","title":"Psalms 66:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":66,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":66,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>broughtest. Job 19:6; La 1:13; 3:2-66; Ho 7:12; Mt 6:13 upon. De 33:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-66-12","title":"Psalms 66:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":66,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":66,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>caused. 129:1-3; Isa 51:23 through. Isa 43:1,2; Ac 14:22; 1Th 3:3,4 but thou. 33:19; 40:2,3; Job 36:16; Lu 16:25; Jas 5:11; Re 7:14-17 wealthy. Heb. moist. 107:35-37; Isa 35:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-66-13","title":"Psalms 66:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":66,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":66,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>go into. 51:18,19; 100:4; 118:19,27; De 12:11,12; Heb 13:15 pay. 22:25; 56:12; 116:14,17-19; Ec 5:4; Jon 2:9; Na 1:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-66-14","title":"Psalms 66:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":66,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":66,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>uttered. Heb. opened. Jud 11:35,36 mouth. Nu 30:2,8,12 when. Ge 28:20-22; 35:3; 1Sa 1:11; 2Sa 22:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-66-15","title":"Psalms 66:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":66,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":66,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>fatlings. Heb. marrow. with the. Jer 41:5 I will offer. 2Sa 6:13,17-19; 1Ch 16:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-66-16","title":"Psalms 66:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":66,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":66,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Come. 5; 34:2,11; 71:18; Mal 3:16; 1Ti 1:15,16; 1Jo 1:3 and I will. 22:23,24; 32:5,6; 71:20; 1Co 15:8-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-66-17","title":"Psalms 66:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":66,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":66,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>I cried. 30:8; 34:3,4,6; 116:1,2,12 he was. 30:1; 145:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-66-18","title":"Psalms 66:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":66,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":66,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>If I regard. Job 27:8,9; Pr 15:8,29; 21:13; 28:9; Isa 1:15; Joh 9:31; Jas 4:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-66-19","title":"Psalms 66:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":66,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":66,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>6:9; 34:6; 116:1,2; La 3:55,56; Heb 5:7; 1Jo 3:20-22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-66-20","title":"Psalms 66:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":66,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":66,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>51:11; 86:12,13; 2Sa 7:14,15</p>"}]}